{"id":"3d2ecd22e6ac1631","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-turing-reduction.md","title":"Polynomial-Time Turing Reduction","display":"df-turing-reduction — Polynomial-Time Turing Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-turing-reduction","aliases":["28-df-turing-reduction","Polynomial-Time Turing Reduction"],"display":"df-turing-reduction — Polynomial-Time Turing Reduction","depends_on":["[[28-df-oracle-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-turing-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-turing-reduction</span><span>Polynomial-Time Turing Reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-reduction — Polynomial-Time Turing Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" href=\"?note=f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" title=\"28-df-oracle-class\">28-df-oracle-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P^B\">\\(\\mathbf P^B\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" href=\"?note=f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" title=\"28-df-oracle-class\">28-df-oracle-class</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T^{\\mathbf P}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\in\\mathbf P^B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_T^{\\mathbf P}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\in\\mathbf P^B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是多项式时间 Cook 归约。确定型机可依据前次回答自适应发出多次查询；查询带书写要计时，回答本身一步完成。以语言类表述避免混用函数输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(x)\">\\(M(x)\\)</span> 与接受谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M)\">\\(L(M)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源核对：习题2.14与定义3.4；印刷65、73页；PDF91、99页。陈述已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-oracle-class","status":"resolved","id":"f4ae5e0b4d42d561","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-oracle-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-oracle-class","status":"resolved","id":"f4ae5e0b4d42d561","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*$；$\\mathbf P^B$ 见 [[28-df-oracle-class]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P^B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\le_T^{\\mathbf P}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\in\\mathbf P^B.","display":true},{"tex":"M(x)","display":false},{"tex":"L(M)","display":false}],"bytes":904,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"预言机：[[28-df-oracle-tm]]、[[28-df-oracle-class]]、[[28-df-turing-reduction]]、[[28-df-relativization]]、[[28-thm-baker-gill-solovay]]。"}],"outgoing":["f4ae5e0b4d42d561"]}